Native MLX MOSS-Image architecture
==================================

The following files in this directory are adapted from the experimental
MOSS-Image implementation in the mflux project:

  transformer.py
  block.py
  rope.py
  text_embedder.py
  scheduler.py
  latent.py

Upstream project:
  https://github.com/vanch007/mflux
  Branch: feature/moss-image-sft
  Commit: b1fe66cc62109f374fe7d713411c589d3810d0c0
  Date:   2026-10-21

Original mflux project:
  https://github.com/filipstrand/mflux
  Copyright (c) 2026 Filip Strand
  License: MIT (see LICENSE in this directory)

Local adaptations:
  - Imports changed from the mflux.models.moss_image package namespace to
    relative imports inside backend/moss_mlx.
  - Added an mflux Q4 checkpoint loader with explicit key mapping and selective
    quantization.
  - Added a mixed-precision FLUX.2 VAE loader using the small MOSS decoder.
  - Added a local MLX Qwen 3.5 text-encoder path.
  - Integrated the three-stage memory lifecycle used by DiffusionBear.

The MOSS-Image model weights are not part of this directory and are covered by
their own upstream licence. See
backend/data/models/moss-image-sft/ATTRIBUTION.md.
